<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Happy Birthday - 11 Juli 2004</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pacifico&family=Quicksand:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --plum: #2b1650;
    --plum-soft: #4a2a7d;
    --coral: #ff6b6b;
    --gold: #ffd166;
    --mint: #6ee7b7;
    --cream: #fff6e5;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  /* ===== KURSOR PANAH CUSTOM (mouse) ===== */
  html, body {
    height: 100%;
    cursor: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='32' height='32' viewBox='0 0 32 32'><path d='M4 3 L4 25 L10 19.5 L14.5 29 L18.5 27 L14 17.8 L22 17.8 Z' fill='%23ffd166' stroke='%232b1650' stroke-width='2' stroke-linejoin='round'/></svg>") 4 3, auto;
  }
  /* kursor saat di atas kartu (bisa diklik) */
  .card, .card * {
    cursor: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='32' height='32' viewBox='0 0 32 32'><path d='M4 3 L4 25 L10 19.5 L14.5 29 L18.5 27 L14 17.8 L22 17.8 Z' fill='%23ff6b6b' stroke='%232b1650' stroke-width='2' stroke-linejoin='round'/></svg>") 4 3, pointer;
  }

  body {
    font-family: "Quicksand", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    color: var(--cream);
    overflow-x: hidden;
    background: var(--plum);
  }

  /* ===== GAMBAR BACKGROUND (<img>) ===== */
  .bg {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    z-index: -3;
  }

  main {
    min-height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.6rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* ===== JUDUL: Happy Birthday ===== */
  .title {
    font-family: "Pacifico", cursive;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 8vw, 4.6rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--coral), 0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  }
  .title span {
    display: inline-block;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(-40px) rotate(-12deg);
    animation: drop .7s cubic-bezier(.3,1.6,.5,1) forwards,
               wave 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    animation-delay: calc(var(--n) * .07s), calc(1.4s + var(--n) * .1s);
  }
  .title .gap { width: .35em; }
  @keyframes drop { to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
  @keyframes wave { 50% { transform: translateY(-7px); } }

  /* ===== KARTU ===== */
  #open { position: absolute; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }

  .card {
    position: relative;
    width: min(88vw, 360px);
    height: 640px;
    perspective: 1400px;
    display: block;
    transition: transform .6s ease;
  }
  #open:checked ~ .card { transform: translateX(0); }
  #open:focus-visible ~ .card { outline: 3px solid var(--mint); outline-offset: 8px; border-radius: 18px; }

  .inside, .cover {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 6px 18px 18px 6px;
  }

  .inside {
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--plum);
    padding: 1.8rem 1.4rem;
    text-align: center;
    overflow-y: auto;
    box-shadow: 0 22px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: .9rem;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at 12% 10%, rgba(255,107,107,.18) 0 40px, transparent 41px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 92% 92%, rgba(110,231,183,.28) 0 55px, transparent 56px);
  }
  .inside .date {
    font-family: "Pacifico", cursive;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--coral);
  }
  .inside h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .inside p {
    font-size: .9rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    font-weight: 500;
    max-width: 36ch;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(10px);
    transition: opacity .6s ease 0s, transform .6s ease 0s;
  }
  .inside .date, .inside h2 { opacity: 0; transition: opacity .6s ease; }
  #open:checked ~ .card .inside .date,
  #open:checked ~ .card .inside h2 { opacity: 1; transition-delay: .6s; }
  #open:checked ~ .card .inside p { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition-delay: 1s; }
  .inside .sign { font-weight: 700; color: var(--plum-soft); }

  .cover {
    transform-origin: left center;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
    transition: transform 1.1s cubic-bezier(.6,.05,.25,1);
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--coral), #ff9a76);
    box-shadow: 0 22px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
    backface-visibility: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    gap: 1rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  #open:checked ~ .card .cover { transform: rotateY(-172deg); }

  .cover::before { /* pola titik */
    content: "";
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.35) 2px, transparent 2.5px);
    background-size: 22px 22px;
  }
  .hint {
    position: relative;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: .95rem;
    background: var(--plum);
    color: var(--gold);
    padding: .5rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    animation: pulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse { 50% { transform: scale(1.08); } }

  /* ===== KUE ULANG TAHUN (CSS) ===== */
  .cake { position: relative; width: 170px; height: 150px; margin-bottom: .3rem; }
  .layer { position: absolute; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); border-radius: 12px; }
  .l1 { bottom: 0;    width: 170px; height: 52px; background: var(--plum); }
  .l2 { bottom: 52px; width: 130px; height: 46px; background: var(--cream); }
  .l3 { bottom: 98px; width: 90px;  height: 36px; background: var(--gold); }
  .l1::after, .l2::after, .l3::after { /* lelehan krim */
    content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; height: 12px;
    border-radius: 12px 12px 8px 8px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.55);
  }
  .candle {
    position: absolute; bottom: 134px; width: 8px; height: 26px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, var(--mint) 0 5px, var(--cream) 5px 10px);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .c1 { left: calc(50% - 26px); }
  .c2 { left: calc(50% - 4px); }
  .c3 { left: calc(50% + 18px); }
  .flame {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; top: -17px; width: 12px; height: 17px;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 70%, #fff6c2, var(--gold) 55%, #ff9a3c);
    border-radius: 50% 50% 50% 50% / 65% 65% 35% 35%;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px var(--gold));
    transform-origin: 50% 100%;
    animation: flicker .5s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  .c2 .flame { animation-delay: -.2s; }
  .c3 .flame { animation-delay: -.35s; }
  @keyframes flicker {
    from { transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1, 1) rotate(-4deg); }
    to   { transform: translateX(-50%) scale(.85, 1.12) rotate(4deg); }
  }

  /* ===== BALON ===== */
  .balloon {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: -140px;
    left: var(--x);
    width: 54px; height: 68px;
    background: var(--c);
    border-radius: 50% 50% 48% 48% / 55% 55% 45% 45%;
    z-index: -1;
    animation: float var(--t) linear infinite;
    animation-delay: var(--d);
    opacity: .9;
  }
  .balloon::after { /* tali */
    content: ""; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 100%;
    width: 2px; height: 70px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.55);
  }
  @keyframes float {
    0%   { transform: translateY(0) translateX(0); }
    50%  { transform: translateY(-62vh) translateX(18px); }
    100% { transform: translateY(-130vh) translateX(-12px); }
  }

  /* ===== KONFETI ===== */
  .confetti {
    position: fixed;
    top: -20px;
    left: var(--x);
    width: 9px; height: 16px;
    background: var(--c);
    z-index: -1;
    animation: fall var(--t) linear infinite;
    animation-delay: var(--d);
  }
  @keyframes fall {
    to { transform: translateY(110vh) rotate(720deg); }
  }


  /* ===== Pengaturan per-elemen (pengganti inline style) ===== */
  .balloon:nth-child(1) { --x:6%;  --c:#ff6b6b; --t:14s; --d:0s; }
  .balloon:nth-child(2) { --x:20%; --c:#ffd166; --t:17s; --d:-6s; }
  .balloon:nth-child(3) { --x:78%; --c:#6ee7b7; --t:15s; --d:-3s; }
  .balloon:nth-child(4) { --x:90%; --c:#ff9a76; --t:18s; --d:-9s; }
  .balloon:nth-child(5) { --x:46%; --c:#b69cff; --t:20s; --d:-12s; }
  .confetti:nth-child(1) { --x:5%;  --c:#ffd166; --t:7s;   --d:0s; }
  .confetti:nth-child(2) { --x:12%; --c:#ff6b6b; --t:9s;   --d:-2s; }
  .confetti:nth-child(3) { --x:19%; --c:#6ee7b7; --t:8s;   --d:-5s; }
  .confetti:nth-child(4) { --x:27%; --c:#fff6e5; --t:10s;  --d:-1s; }
  .confetti:nth-child(5) { --x:34%; --c:#ffd166; --t:7.5s; --d:-4s; }
  .confetti:nth-child(6) { --x:41%; --c:#b69cff; --t:9.5s; --d:-7s; }
  .confetti:nth-child(7) { --x:49%; --c:#ff6b6b; --t:8.5s; --d:-3s; }
  .confetti:nth-child(8) { --x:56%; --c:#6ee7b7; --t:7s;   --d:-6s; }
  .confetti:nth-child(9) { --x:63%; --c:#ffd166; --t:10s;  --d:-8s; }
  .confetti:nth-child(10) { --x:71%; --c:#fff6e5; --t:8s;   --d:-2.5s; }
  .confetti:nth-child(11) { --x:78%; --c:#ff9a76; --t:9s;   --d:-5.5s; }
  .confetti:nth-child(12) { --x:86%; --c:#b69cff; --t:7.5s; --d:-1.5s; }
  .confetti:nth-child(13) { --x:93%; --c:#ffd166; --t:8.8s; --d:-4.5s; }
  .title span:nth-child(1) { --n: 0; }
  .title span:nth-child(2) { --n: 1; }
  .title span:nth-child(3) { --n: 2; }
  .title span:nth-child(4) { --n: 3; }
  .title span:nth-child(5) { --n: 4; }
  .title span:nth-child(6) { --n: 5; }
  .title span:nth-child(7) { --n: 5; }
  .title span:nth-child(8) { --n: 6; }
  .title span:nth-child(9) { --n: 7; }
  .title span:nth-child(10) { --n: 8; }
  .title span:nth-child(11) { --n: 9; }
  .title span:nth-child(12) { --n: 10; }
  .title span:nth-child(13) { --n: 11; }
  .title span:nth-child(14) { --n: 12; }

  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .card { height: 700px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    * { animation: none !important; transition-duration: .01s !important; }
    .title span { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!--
  GAMBAR BACKGROUND:
  Sekarang pakai gambar SVG bawaan (langit malam + bintang).
  Mau pakai fotomu sendiri? Ganti isi src="..." dengan nama file,
  contoh: src="foto-background.jpg"
-->
<img class="bg" alt="" src="SelfLove.jpg">
<!-- Balon -->
<div class="balloons">
  <div class="balloon"></div>
  <div class="balloon"></div>
  <div class="balloon"></div>
  <div class="balloon"></div>
  <div class="balloon"></div>
</div>

<!-- Konfeti -->
<div class="confettis">
  <div class="confetti"></div>
  <div class="confetti"></div>
  <div class="confetti"></div>
  <div class="confetti"></div>
  <div class="confetti"></div>
  <div class="confetti"></div>
  <div class="confetti"></div>
  <div class="confetti"></div>
  <div class="confetti"></div>
  <div class="confetti"></div>
  <div class="confetti"></div>
  <div class="confetti"></div>
  <div class="confetti"></div>
</div>

<main>
  <h1 class="title" aria-label="Happy Birthday">
    <span>H</span><span>a</span><span>p</span><span>p</span><span>y</span><span class="gap"></span><span>B</span><span>i</span><span>r</span><span>t</span><span>h</span><span>d</span><span>a</span><span>y</span>
  </h1>

  <input type="checkbox" id="open" aria-label="Buka kartu">
  <label class="card" for="open">

    <!-- Isi dalam kartu -->
    <div class="inside">
      <div class="date">11 Juli 2004</div>
      <h2>Happy birthday to me. 🤍</h2>
      <p>
        seseorang yang pernah terasa lebih dari sekadar teman, Terima kasih sudah menjadi bagian dari ceritaku, meski mungkin bukan bagian dari masa depanku.
        Di usia yang baru ini, aku ingin belajar menerima tanpa menyalahkan, melepaskan tanpa membenci, dan mencintai tanpa kehilangan diriku sendiri.
        Aku tidak harus memiliki semua yang aku sayangi. Aku hanya perlu belajar bahwa kehilangan kemungkinan bukan berarti kehilangan masa depan.
        Semoga tahun ini aku lebih tenang, lebih kuat, dan lebih dekat dengan versi diriku yang selama ini ingin aku temui.
        
        This time, I choose myself. Not because I stopped caring, but because I deserve to be cared for, too. ✨
      </p>
      <p class="sign">Dengan JustFriend, untukmu paling Special🎂</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Sampul depan kartu -->
    <div class="cover">
      <div class="cake" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="candle c1"><div class="flame"></div></div>
        <div class="candle c2"><div class="flame"></div></div>
        <div class="candle c3"><div class="flame"></div></div>
        <div class="layer l3"></div>
        <div class="layer l2"></div>
        <div class="layer l1"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hint">Klik untuk membuka kartu</div>
    </div>

  </label>
</main>

</body>
</html>
